# Ship through deploy

Follow **Definition of done** and **Completing work** in `AGENTS.md`. Commands: `.cursor/skills/release-and-deploy/SKILL.md`.

Commit, open the pull request, get **Test MyAPES Core** green, merge to `main`, then dispatch **Deploy MyAPES Core to Cloudron**. Do not stop between those steps for permission. Stop when CI is red, when a secret or a person is required, or when the owner says stop. Name the step and give the exact command.

The GitHub Release (`v{VERSION}`, display name `{VERSION} Beta`) is created by the deploy workflow after a successful deploy. Do not create it by hand unless that publish job failed.

End every report with the Next actions block from `AGENTS.md`.
